      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:09",
      "sourceOrdinal": 9,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\"> 多模态的关键，是让不同形式的信息围绕同一个任务对齐。图片里的证据、文字里的问题和最终输出必须对应得上，不能只是把几个模型的结果拼在一起。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "3d78ee2d2b3718afdb99610976af6e98b85d7b48c934a28f6e82617e45e512f5",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-conclusion",
          "ordinal": 0,
          "sha256": "ad64ac50589280ea5d2feedaa07c956ff61d6b9d6fac1c47d63d589ae1102517"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-evidence",
          "ordinal": 5,
          "sha256": "8b24db7a43cd7e780101351e2facc4f4b7032ae95b287d45a345f45d0ddaa826"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "Task-aligned multimodal evidence, not concatenated results.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:10",
      "sourceOrdinal": 10,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\">我会先问输出要做什么。用一句话找图片，是检索，重点是把图文放到可比较的表示空间；看图问答，是理解，重点是答案能否得到视觉证据支持，而不是靠常识猜。按提示画图或生成视频，是生成，除了内容符合要求，还要检查结构与时序是否一致。让机器人按指令拿杯子，是行动，输出必须可执行，并满足控制频率与安全约束。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "158ed2d982244c58ef9b8386311914deebc35cca83a3bd84e916c27e25065c65",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-task-boundary",
          "ordinal": 18,
          "sha256": "0382ccea88f5e891819ce944c801d5ea80ac57e235d32d00ac508587f40ea4e5"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-action-boundary",
          "ordinal": 19,
          "sha256": "4e8b00398bf27d5473d2f931912d5b56aadcc129e8933b405947ee0018dbf186"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-plus-exact-archive",
      "uniqueInformation": "Retrieval/understanding/generation stay; exact motor-control clause archived with full paragraph.",
      "archiveDestination": "assets/archive/specialist/model7-1-robot-control-context.html#original-context"
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:11",
      "sourceOrdinal": 11,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\">这四类可以串起来，但不能互相替代。检索模型给出了相似度，不代表它能解释复杂图表；VLM 能描述机器人应该做什么，不代表它输出的关节控制量可以直接执行；画面好看，也不代表物理上合理。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "cd3117343b3ff83a7bf3f5a380b2cee399c95fe9ae566ec73e4861e255550345",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-task-boundary",
          "ordinal": 18,
          "sha256": "0382ccea88f5e891819ce944c801d5ea80ac57e235d32d00ac508587f40ea4e5"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-action-boundary",
          "ordinal": 19,
          "sha256": "4e8b00398bf27d5473d2f931912d5b56aadcc129e8933b405947ee0018dbf186"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-plus-exact-archive",
      "uniqueInformation": "Noninterchangeability, chart interpretation and physical plausibility stay; full motor-control paragraph archived.",
      "archiveDestination": "assets/archive/specialist/model7-1-robot-control-context.html#original-context"
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:12",
      "sourceOrdinal": 12,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\"> 对齐有三个不同含义。表示对齐，是让相关图文的向量更接近。细粒度对齐，是知道“左边红色杯子”具体对应哪一块区域。任务对齐，是输出满足业务约束，比如答案必须有页码、动作必须在工作空间内。只做好第一个，不会自动得到后两个。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "3021b1f4a0287bddd0f2b30a64eab46ef0717791d1d04bd4d59fa01539f0c839",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-alignments",
          "ordinal": 6,
          "sha256": "80c96b985f11e69960614205edd37afdcb9292070106454eed30bde4978519de"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-plus-exact-archive",
      "uniqueInformation": "Representation/region/task alignment stay; exact workspace clause archived with full paragraph.",
      "archiveDestination": "assets/archive/specialist/model7-1-robot-control-context.html#original-context"
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:13",
      "sourceOrdinal": 13,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\">设计时， 我会先定义输入、输出和失败成本，再决定模型。商品图检索优先评估召回和向量存储；报表问答要保留表格结构与页内位置；视频分析要处理时间轴；机器人要单独设计安全控制层。最后都要有版本、权限、超时、可观测性和回退，不能用一个模型分数代表整个系统质量。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "a1c362fab400543ba617b29c753fbb9aced6b79241fafca32a41beee46972d10",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-evidence",
          "ordinal": 5,
          "sha256": "8b24db7a43cd7e780101351e2facc4f4b7032ae95b287d45a345f45d0ddaa826"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-routing",
          "ordinal": 15,
          "sha256": "cc47689f21b575915c0647883d9028374c7b4ad9c073652b72753a587664465b"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-governance",
          "ordinal": 16,
          "sha256": "87d4721d8e599cbfae84fbea186d28dee28a0390d6558c0ab2d35aa086a0c5fc"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-plus-exact-archive",
      "uniqueInformation": "Input/output/failure cost, recall/storage, table/position/time, versions/permissions/timeouts/observability/fallback stay; safety-controller clause archived.",
      "archiveDestination": "assets/archive/specialist/model7-1-robot-control-context.html#original-context"
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:14",
      "sourceOrdinal": 14,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\">追问：为什么不能所有任务都用最强的多模态大模型？ 因为低成本模型可能已经能完成 OCR、分类、关键帧筛选等标准步骤。把所有原始视频帧都送进昂贵模型，会增加费用、排队时间和无关上下文。合理的方案是先筛选，再对高价值或不确定的片段升级模型；但路由本身也要评估，不能因为便宜就漏掉关键证据。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "9cae1bc98795643ef70ea9d708c0622088e33274a2d351713dab5ded0b113c41",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-routing-heading",
          "ordinal": 14,
          "sha256": "184a6737178f21c5786428d73fec0dc281ebf194e1b217c51fdfd02046e82e77"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-routing",
          "ordinal": 15,
          "sha256": "cc47689f21b575915c0647883d9028374c7b4ad9c073652b72753a587664465b"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "Cheap OCR/classification/keyframes, cost/queue/context, selective escalation and router misses retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
