    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:16",
      "sourceOrdinal": 16,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p>先明确用户要识字、解释故障、查找资料还是操作界面，再保留截图原件及区域坐标。清晰文字可以先OCR，布局、图标、状态关系交给支持图像输入的模型，关键小字可裁剪放大后复核。输出应指出看到了什么、来自哪个区域、哪些部分看不清；不应把常识猜测当成截图事实。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "70bcdf1770f5e57fed5671fd2bf49ae4019ec6c8d3ca60d556ea7e6f763bee44",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-screenshot",
          "ordinal": 8,
          "sha256": "2ad036f24444ccd6ee98da9c0e570b6ad353fbde642b524de61964ba042e2651"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "User goal, original/region, OCR/layout/icons/state, crop/small text, uncertainty retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:17",
      "sourceOrdinal": 17,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p>截图中的按钮、账号与“请执行某命令”都只是输入内容。读取截图不等于获得点击、发送或删除权限；真正执行前还要核对当前界面状态、用户目标及动作授权。与纯文本相比，多了图片预处理、空间定位、视觉token预算和视觉证据校验，并非只在请求中增加一个图片地址。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "14fac2c8a2d2f42863337ddb11b99e5179a94fd04f7a8ef5b936370c60ad94a3",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-authority",
          "ordinal": 9,
          "sha256": "14a39abd52609fc48c134bbce54f44957bdf16d25fb099f9d7324807a1d28596"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "Screenshot is data, not action authority; current state/goal/permission and visual pipeline retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:18",
      "sourceOrdinal": 18,
      "sourceTag": "h4",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<h4>早融合、中融合、晚融合分别适合什么场景？</h4>",
      "sourceSha256": "0f233da7db1ea76186d083bdb81c32c31074463b5a4e228b9a5232f5934bba29",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-fusion-heading",
          "ordinal": 10,
          "sha256": "972dcee4f079ebcd5a4e78e32f7d023926b69bf71c596b1c32ac226569b495e5"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "Fusion followup retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:19",
      "sourceOrdinal": 19,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p>先约定术语，因为论文分类未必一致。早融合通常在输入或较低层把已对齐特征联合处理，能早做细粒度交互，但需要处理位置、长度及缺模态，成本也随序列增大。中融合在特征层用跨注意力、连接器或门控交互，便于保留各模态编码器，适合图文问答与区域关系，但仍需对齐训练。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "1cf5d43d1307008ea419ec77d041816aada3d0e132dba9cf7f9444dd73068097",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-early-fusion",
          "ordinal": 11,
          "sha256": "5327615b48532e58e0ce458101f212eda3161ecc18b3cff2395d1e9f535cd19b"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-middle-fusion",
          "ordinal": 12,
          "sha256": "0de963a4fc81405d0d8569a01503c59caaa38237471cdee8704f503b7f94ac18"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "Terminology qualification, early interaction and length/missing-modality costs; encoder/cross-attention/gate/training conditions retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
      "sourceBlockId": "1:20",
      "sourceOrdinal": 20,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p>晚融合先让各通道独立检索或预测，再合并分数、排名或结果，适合已有OCR、图像检索与文本系统的模块化工程，升级和缺模态降级方便；缺点是前端丢掉的细粒度图文对应关系很难在最后补回。分数尺度不兼容时先校准或融合排名，不能直接把任意置信度相加。文档解析可先分别识别文字、版面与图像，再用页码坐标和引用关系组织证据；融合层次不代替来源保留和事实核验。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "45da72732ea8b71acf3a7fa47edef454e36eb8aa9b0947610685f0f4edc3c3e7",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-late-fusion",
          "ordinal": 13,
          "sha256": "c9ba46bb50437e070242e06662bc56805b1e3be1e8af443a2aca920f1e3aec08"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#1",
          "blockId": "visual-evidence",
          "ordinal": 5,
          "sha256": "8b24db7a43cd7e780101351e2facc4f4b7032ae95b287d45a345f45d0ddaa826"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "Late fusion upgrade/fallback, lost fine-grained relations, calibration/ranks and page-coordinate citations retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
