    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
      "sourceBlockId": "2:00",
      "sourceOrdinal": 0,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\">最大的差别是实时语音多了一组必须同步管理的交互状态：用户是否还在说话、这一轮是否结束、音频播到了哪里，以及用户打断后旧结果是否还能播放。文本也能要求低延迟和流式输出，所以不能简单说语音是实时、文本是异步。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "952a05d334171329123f62adab170d7e9ca9c29e692d59c67bf8cd5c176a88f0",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-conclusion",
          "ordinal": 0,
          "sha256": "936690f440d6158d93f61ae071a7ec9d1219d55e2e562035aaa51204a15b7fdc"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "All four interaction-state concerns; text can be streaming and low latency retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
      "sourceBlockId": "2:01",
      "sourceOrdinal": 1,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\">如果是 ASR→模型→TTS 的级联路线，可以按片段衔接，让部分阶段重叠，但因为后一步依赖前一步的结果，不能把整轮说成完全并行。原生语音到语音模型未必有独立 ASR/TTS 接口。无论哪条路线，都要定义首次可听响应、连续播放和打断停播的预算，并处理过期轮次和取消。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "1f74f5751cd191b89e52344573314e3242fb190725ecf33fd4665b1fd21b957b",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-cascade",
          "ordinal": 2,
          "sha256": "7ec940cc8305a4d24520db70ae463687515d90ce230eef3d9ca41f270f986238"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-native",
          "ordinal": 3,
          "sha256": "f291be32b31d355091a9af5c3bd1a504b8fb98433687c0ebd807dd98f0a19844"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-state",
          "ordinal": 5,
          "sha256": "8e92b3f6607d17b59cba95c733d3511f1aa14fb9f75370d6a1fd71754370c996"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-budget",
          "ordinal": 6,
          "sha256": "4be7d7194da64efada409f5ae19523c62a465c8da81b92fdae50075a52b825a5"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "Dependent stages may overlap, native interfaces differ, audible/continuous/interrupt budgets, late rounds/cancel retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
      "sourceBlockId": "2:02",
      "sourceOrdinal": 2,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\">任务执行方式另按需求决定：即时交互层可以先反馈状态，再让较慢的检索或多步工具任务在后台继续；文本长任务同样可以约定异步完成。两种模态都要做权限检查和失败降级，不能为了快省掉必要的授权和事实核验。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "262f6f2b558e9bd3107272a2f8fd48aebc20a36d88e5275e762bb25fc3d1daf3",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-budget",
          "ordinal": 6,
          "sha256": "4be7d7194da64efada409f5ae19523c62a465c8da81b92fdae50075a52b825a5"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "Fast status plus slow background task, text async, permissions/facts/fallback retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
      "sourceBlockId": "2:03",
      "sourceOrdinal": 3,
      "sourceTag": "h2",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<h2 class=\"md-h md-h2\" id=\"add-zzz-extended-wave3-voice-critical-path-replay\">流式语音各段都很快，为什么用户仍觉得慢？怎样重放才有诊断价值？</h2>",
      "sourceSha256": "55e8034fd676c7202ccfa61adbc9167383b681420e1a4b1e2d64d838ab9afe12",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-latency-heading",
          "ordinal": 7,
          "sha256": "58e8588615d305af98c2ef3d25e5770d29766a5e9999defebb316cc2b0b88702"
        },
        {
