    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
      "sourceBlockId": "2:04",
      "sourceOrdinal": 4,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\">以 ASR→模型→TTS 的级联路线为例，先统一计时起止。用户停止说话、系统确认这一轮结束、ASR给出稳定文本、LLM产出首个有效文本片段、TTS返回首个可解码音频，以及客户端真正开始播放，是不同事件。服务端收到首音频字节，不等于用户已经听到；还可能有网络、解码和播放缓冲。确认轮次结束本身也可能引入等待，不能只从ASR请求发出后开始计时。原生语音到语音路线应按实际暴露的事件计时，不能虚构独立 ASR 或 TTS 阶段。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "6dff2f66135da5ecec20e83b0f1afa3df9db8373e490981568478d8a3226cb60",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-events",
          "ordinal": 8,
          "sha256": "b9f8423fd999c000bb67e4eade960204ab9aee64d830931dca1335075e3e3b88"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-extra-delays",
          "ordinal": 9,
          "sha256": "cd9e9a137ed842ed60fec59242a13099e7da27f74044c10a71017e775fb15236"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-native",
          "ordinal": 3,
          "sha256": "f291be32b31d355091a9af5c3bd1a504b8fb98433687c0ebd807dd98f0a19844"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "All six timestamps, actual audible endpoint, network/decode/buffer, turn-end wait, native-event boundaries retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
      "sourceBlockId": "2:05",
      "sourceOrdinal": 5,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\">给同一会话的轮次、片段和版本建立关联，记录阶段等待、执行和排队时间。流式阶段会重叠，端到端时间应看实际关键路径，不能把各组件平均耗时相加，更不能把各组件的p95相加当成整条链的p95。分别观察首次可听响应、后续音频断续、整轮完成和用户打断到旧音频停止的延迟；用相同负载、输入长度与缓存条件比较。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "c164d420116206d9ea56fc1c9ccc3eb391743370af4b4541113443c3396d1d71",
      "destinations": [
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-state",
          "ordinal": 5,
          "sha256": "8e92b3f6607d17b59cba95c733d3511f1aa14fb9f75370d6a1fd71754370c996"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-extra-delays",
          "ordinal": 9,
          "sha256": "cd9e9a137ed842ed60fec59242a13099e7da27f74044c10a71017e775fb15236"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-critical-path",
          "ordinal": 10,
          "sha256": "2aa18d551067d80d857538075ca3ff6a39575748355e4a3c80c4487fbee9e9c8"
        },
        {
          "stableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
          "blockId": "voice-metrics",
          "ordinal": 11,
          "sha256": "bb7cf1334d062c086cb7fb4b45ba69c5c03e2712c41b5018fc8ef57eb7a9ec80"
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "retain-and-restructure",
      "uniqueInformation": "Session/turn/chunk/version, queue/wait/execute, critical path and non-additive percentiles, four metrics, comparable workloads retained.",
      "archiveDestination": null
    },
    {
      "sourceStableReviewKey": "ai-模型与评测-7#2",
      "sourceBlockId": "2:06",
      "sourceOrdinal": 6,
      "sourceTag": "p",
      "sourceRawHtml": "<p class=\"md-p\">重放也要区分目的。只重放最终转写文本适合查后续语义链路，查不到分帧、迟到片段、ASR修订或轮次结束判断的问题。为了调试流式行为，应在获准保留的最少录音与事件上，保留相对时间、分片边界、partial/final修订、打断及服务错误；用替身固定外部响应可复现运行时问题，重新调用真实模型则是另一次集成实验。</p>",
      "sourceSha256": "3e34ed2c9468013fc00f962d3a1fc3fb147049f92a775e9efe8f022f70a1b3d9",
      "destinations": [
        {
